  "source": "// Fade: PWM on pin 9 ramps an LED up and down with analogWrite().\nconst int ledPin = 9;\nint brightness = 0;\nint step = 5;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(ledPin, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  analogWrite(ledPin, brightness);\n  brightness += step;\n  if (brightness <= 0 || brightness >= 255) step = -step;\n  delay(30);\n}\n",
