  "source": "// Interrupt counter: each press of the button on pin 2 (INT0, falling edge) is counted in an ISR.\nvolatile unsigned int presses = 0;\nunsigned int shown = 0;\n\nvoid onPress() {\n  presses++;\n}\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  pinMode(2, INPUT_PULLUP);\n  attachInterrupt(digitalPinToInterrupt(2), onPress, FALLING);\n  Serial.println(\"Press the button on pin 2\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  noInterrupts();\n  unsigned int count = presses;\n  interrupts();\n  if (count != shown) {\n    shown = count;\n    Serial.print(\"Presses: \");\n    Serial.println(count);\n    digitalWrite(13, count & 1);\n  }\n}\n",
